msgstr "Jidka buuxa ee furaha 32-byte ah ee loo isticmaalo in lagu sireeyo calaamadaha API ee kaydsan. Waa inuu noqdaa mid ay akhrin karaan isticmaalayaasha web server-ka iyo poller-ka, mana aha inuu noqdo mid qof kasta akhrin karo. Marka faylku maqan yahay, waxaa la isticmaali karaa oo keliya faylasha calaamadda."

