msgstr "Jidka buuxa ee galka ay tahay inuu ku jiro fayl kasta oo calaamadda koontada ah. Marka uu madhan yahay, faylka calaamadda wuxuu ku jiri karaa meel kasta oo ay isticmaalayaasha web server-ka iyo poller-ka akhrin karaan."

